AUDIO: 'thing with good lighting, you know, you set your settings correctly, equally comparable to a professional camera. The reason why I love using the Ace Pro 2 is because I have an iPhone 16 Pro and while it does take really good photos and videos, I am always filling up the'

[01:03] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'storage and I don\'t want to pay for more iCloud storage. I\'m sure you guys understand. Once a month I have to delete everything, [music] I have to upload it to Google Drive and then now my Google Drive is getting full and now'

